-- ทะเบียนสีธีม: ทุกชิ้นที่ใช้สีธีมลงทะเบียนไว้ เปลี่ยนธีมแล้ววาดใหม่ทันที
local PAINT = {}
local function paint(fn)
	PAINT[#PAINT + 1] = fn
	fn()
end
local function repaint()
	for i = #PAINT, 1, -1 do pcall(PAINT[i]) end
end

local function tw(o, t, props, style, dir)
	local tween = TweenService:Create(o, TweenInfo.new(t, style or QUAD, dir or OUT), props)
	tween:Play()
	return tween
end
local function new(cls, props, parent)
	local o = Instance.new(cls)
	for k, v in pairs(props or {}) do o[k] = v end
	if parent then o.Parent = parent end
	return o
end
local function corner(o, r) return new("UICorner", { CornerRadius = UDim.new(0, r or 8) }, o) end
local function apply(o, props) for k, v in pairs(props or {}) do o[k] = v end return o end
local function stroke(o, col, th, tr)
	return new("UIStroke", { Color = col or C.line, Thickness = th or 1, Transparency = tr or 0.5, ApplyStrokeMode = BORDER }, o)
end
local function accGrad(parent, rot)
	local g = new("UIGradient", { Rotation = rot or 0 }, parent)
	paint(function() g.Color = ColorSequence.new(C.acc, C.acc2) end)
	return g
end
local function pad(o, t, r, b, l)
	return new("UIPadding", { PaddingTop = UDim.new(0, t or 0), PaddingRight = UDim.new(0, r or 0), PaddingBottom = UDim.new(0, b or 0), PaddingLeft = UDim.new(0, l or 0) }, o)
end
local function counter()
	local n = 0
	return function() n = n + 1 return n end
end

local function txt(parent, t, props)
